1
00:00:00,680 --> 00:00:06,140
Nightitten months will be the same long time

2
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:08,580
Everything falls down So let's go

3
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:09,260
Make it fun!

4
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:23,460
The wind lung is somewhere

5
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:26,540
It came across north side

6
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:29,640
Wherefore wherever they come

7
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:43,080
目奪われて 音を立て、ときめきの予感 真っ白な秘めた気持ちが色づいてゆく

8
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:56,460
最後は君と紡いでいく未来 今はまだ財探りで迷っても

9
00:00:56,460 --> 00:01:01,760
Hopeful, 描き出す 光

10
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:07,580
花色の明日が呼んでる

11
00:01:07,580 --> 00:01:10,440
道知るってなくたって

12
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:12,140
不安だね

13
00:01:12,140 --> 00:01:13,140
分け合って

14
00:01:13,140 --> 00:01:15,940
君がいるいつだって

15
00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:17,720
ほら笑って

16
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:18,920
High five!

17
00:01:26,460 --> 00:01:36,460
コフィン コスプレー

18
00:01:36,460 --> 00:01:37,040
That's it.

19
00:01:37,040 --> 00:01:40,140
After we wrap up the Coffin cosplay, I'm gonna tell him.

20
00:01:40,140 --> 00:01:42,380
I have no choice. I have to.

21
00:01:42,380 --> 00:01:45,040
I have to tell Gojo that I love him.

22
00:01:45,040 --> 00:01:49,680
So the big day is finally here.

23
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:52,360
Once we finish, I've gotta tell him that I love him.

24
00:01:52,360 --> 00:01:54,060
No ifs, ands, or buts.

25
00:01:54,060 --> 00:01:57,660
I said I would do it, so I'm gonna.

26
00:01:57,660 --> 00:02:00,700
Hey Gojo, one thing.

27
00:02:00,700 --> 00:02:03,900
Don't laugh, but I wanted to tell you that...

28
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:06,140
That I...

29
00:02:06,140 --> 00:02:07,580
That I...

30
00:02:07,580 --> 00:02:09,100
Love...

31
00:02:09,100 --> 00:02:09,980
YOU!

32
00:02:09,980 --> 00:02:16,540
Fart corny to the max!

33
00:02:16,540 --> 00:02:20,620
Good morning.

34
00:02:20,620 --> 00:02:21,660
Morning?

35
00:02:21,660 --> 00:02:23,420
Uh, come in.

36
00:02:23,420 --> 00:02:24,960
Right.

37
00:02:24,960 --> 00:02:26,560
Let's start on your makeup.

38
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,300
Kay.

39
00:02:27,300 --> 00:02:28,120
Oh, yeah.

40
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:29,860
I already put on foundation.

41
00:02:29,860 --> 00:02:31,400
Oh, that's super helpful.

42
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:32,300
Thank you.

43
00:02:40,140 --> 00:02:41,200
Kitagawa?

44
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:42,200
Huh?

45
00:02:43,440 --> 00:02:45,500
Could you do me a favor and look up a little higher for me?

46
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:46,640
Perfect.

47
00:02:46,640 --> 00:02:48,140
Hold it just like that.

48
00:02:48,140 --> 00:02:51,880
I think I'll start with your eyes today.

49
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:53,480
Uh-huh.

50
00:02:53,480 --> 00:02:55,640
Do I have it in me?

51
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:59,040
Can I confess for realsies?

52
00:02:59,040 --> 00:03:00,040
Uh-huh.

53
00:03:00,040 --> 00:03:00,580
Uh-huh.

54
00:03:00,580 --> 00:03:01,180
Uh-huh.

55
00:03:01,180 --> 00:03:02,180
Uh-huh.

56
00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:03,780
Morning, everyone.

57
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:05,320
Hey, hey, girly pop.

58
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:07,120
Morning, Suzuka.

59
00:03:07,120 --> 00:03:09,860
The date is finally here.

60
00:03:09,860 --> 00:03:12,020
The whole studio is pitch black.

61
00:03:12,020 --> 00:03:12,520
Yep.

62
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:15,720
I figured if we kept it simple, then the gore could really pop.

63
00:03:15,720 --> 00:03:17,000
Hard core?

64
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:21,000
I thought about renting a church, but the focus of this shoot should be on the people, not the background.

65
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:24,400
And the darkness reflects Mira's mental state.

66
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:26,100
I guess so.

67
00:03:26,100 --> 00:03:28,400
Hey, is Akira here?

68
00:03:28,400 --> 00:03:30,780
She just changed and is chilling in the shower.

69
00:03:33,520 --> 00:03:35,780
Screen fricking accurate!

70
00:03:35,780 --> 00:03:36,920
Looks great.

71
00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:38,860
I think Suzuka made those for us.

72
00:03:41,620 --> 00:03:42,760
I should change.

73
00:03:42,760 --> 00:03:44,560
We got a dressing room around here.

74
00:03:44,560 --> 00:03:46,120
Out the door and to the left.

75
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:48,120
Mia and the others are changing right now.

76
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,520
Last one in, Zara!

77
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:50,260
Next!

78
00:03:50,260 --> 00:03:51,260
Uh-huh.

79
00:03:59,740 --> 00:04:00,800
Almost forgot.

80
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,800
Since we only have one dressing room, you'll have-

81
00:04:02,800 --> 00:04:03,800
AAAAAAAH!

82
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:04,300
AAAAAAAH!

83
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:05,300
AAAAAAAH!

84
00:04:05,300 --> 00:04:06,300
I'm sorry!

85
00:04:06,300 --> 00:04:08,380
Force of habit, I guess.

86
00:04:08,380 --> 00:04:11,680
When I lived at home, it was no big deal to change in front of my sis.

87
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:12,920
That makes sense.

88
00:04:14,460 --> 00:04:16,680
If it really doesn't bother you...

89
00:04:17,620 --> 00:04:19,220
By all means, continue.

90
00:04:19,220 --> 00:04:20,220
You good girl.

91
00:04:20,660 --> 00:04:21,380
EEEEH!

92
00:04:21,380 --> 00:04:23,000
WOOOOOOO!

93
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:26,760
You're literally sister Mira right now, Shinju!

94
00:04:28,400 --> 00:04:31,260
And your sister Claire is perfection, Juju.

95
00:04:31,260 --> 00:04:33,760
I'm glad to see you aren't dreading this, as well.

96
00:04:33,760 --> 00:04:38,640
I can't believe the past two days of my life have been so jam-packed with gorgeous Juju cosplay!

97
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:40,380
Endless dream of a woos!

98
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:42,260
Crying will just smear your makeup.

99
00:04:43,660 --> 00:04:46,140
I'm ready! The room is all yours.

100
00:04:46,900 --> 00:04:48,360
Hey, Miyako! Good morning!

101
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:50,800
You can have the changing room now, Maureen.

102
00:04:51,300 --> 00:04:52,940
Shinju, let's get the girls wrapped.

103
00:04:53,340 --> 00:04:53,740
Right!

104
00:04:56,940 --> 00:05:00,380
Is it too tight? If it gets hard to breathe, then we'll take a break.

105
00:05:00,940 --> 00:05:01,860
Feels fine now.

106
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:05,160
Tis a risky game.

107
00:05:05,880 --> 00:05:08,640
Her boobs could explode out of there like when we cosplayed Blaze.

108
00:05:10,220 --> 00:05:12,100
So I can be on Boobwatch.

109
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,080
Thank you so much!

110
00:05:13,220 --> 00:05:14,880
You're just gonna stare at her bazongas?

111
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:25,180
Done. Let's get creepy.

112
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:30,660
Once you put your cosplay on, we can finally bring this dream into the real world!

113
00:05:30,660 --> 00:05:31,120
Yay!

114
00:05:33,760 --> 00:06:00,000
You're a genius.

115
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:03,800
When you shoot from above, you can't tell that they're different heights at all!

116
00:06:03,960 --> 00:06:04,360
Right?

117
00:06:05,380 --> 00:06:07,300
Height's no problem when you have a ladder.

118
00:06:08,460 --> 00:06:09,880
They look so natural.

119
00:06:11,880 --> 00:06:13,340
Can I get a sneak peek?

120
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:14,260
Same here!

121
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:16,320
Sure! Come check our work.

122
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:20,740
Maureen and I look like we're the exact same height!

123
00:06:20,740 --> 00:06:24,700
Ha ha! This rules! You're a legit wizard, Suzuka!

124
00:06:24,700 --> 00:06:26,920
Oh, you're too sweet! Thank you, Maureen!

125
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,660
The height thing is cool for sure!

126
00:06:28,660 --> 00:06:32,000
But how do our cosplays look? Do we look like the characters?

127
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,000
Hells yeah!

128
00:06:34,580 --> 00:06:36,580
Is this the fake blood the studio prepared?

129
00:06:37,580 --> 00:06:40,260
Mm-hmm. It's really thick, so I'll thin it out with water.

130
00:06:40,260 --> 00:06:43,060
They achieved the perfect shade of deep red.

131
00:06:43,060 --> 00:06:45,480
Great work! Now let's move on to the dinner scene.

132
00:06:46,260 --> 00:06:47,560
Kay!

133
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:49,560
Let the blood path begin.

134
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:51,560
Time to say bye-bye, Mia!

135
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:54,560
Bye-bye! I am the one who dies first, after all.

136
00:06:54,560 --> 00:06:56,560
I hope my body's tasty.

137
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:58,560
You're too energetic for a dead girl.

138
00:06:58,560 --> 00:06:59,860
Ha ha ha ha!

139
00:06:59,860 --> 00:07:00,860
Oh, but wait!

140
00:07:00,860 --> 00:07:02,860
I still have to plate up the crops and big blood,

141
00:07:02,860 --> 00:07:03,860
so you guys sit tight.

142
00:07:03,860 --> 00:07:04,860
Okay!

143
00:07:04,860 --> 00:07:05,860
Sure thing!

144
00:07:05,860 --> 00:07:07,860
Soup's almost up, everybody!

145
00:07:07,860 --> 00:07:08,860
Soup's almost up, everybody!

146
00:07:08,860 --> 00:07:09,860
Don't look down.

147
00:07:09,860 --> 00:07:11,860
Under no circumstances look down.

148
00:07:11,860 --> 00:07:14,860
It kind of looks like a beef stew with big chunks of meat.

149
00:07:14,860 --> 00:07:15,860
Don't look down.

150
00:07:15,860 --> 00:07:16,860
It's so true!

151
00:07:16,860 --> 00:07:18,860
Shiju, yours has an ear in it!

152
00:07:18,860 --> 00:07:19,860
Don't look down!

153
00:07:19,860 --> 00:07:20,860
I'm so lifelike!

154
00:07:20,860 --> 00:07:21,860
Huh?

155
00:07:24,860 --> 00:07:25,860
Huh?

156
00:07:25,860 --> 00:07:28,660
Do I have the cutest secret admirer or something?

157
00:07:28,660 --> 00:07:30,160
Because you're like Toad staring me down?

158
00:07:30,160 --> 00:07:33,160
Your dumb face is simply the lesser of two evils, okay?

159
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:38,160
Whoa, that looks delish!

160
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,160
It's papier-mache.

161
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:41,160
A cake?

162
00:07:41,160 --> 00:07:43,160
What is it for?

163
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:47,160
I got so scared that I couldn't finish the game.

164
00:07:47,160 --> 00:07:49,160
I don't know the whole story.

165
00:07:49,160 --> 00:07:51,160
Does it get even worse?

166
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:53,160
Watch out!

167
00:07:55,860 --> 00:07:57,160
What is it for?

168
00:08:10,160 --> 00:08:11,160
Thank you for the meal.

169
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,160
Sajuna, dear.

170
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:16,160
I have a secret.

171
00:08:17,160 --> 00:08:20,160
I added veggies to the soup that you don't typically like.

172
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:21,460
Huh?

173
00:08:22,960 --> 00:08:26,460
The truth is, I added them to yesterday's lasagna too.

174
00:08:26,460 --> 00:08:28,460
And to lunch as well.

175
00:08:28,460 --> 00:08:30,460
I pureed them so you wouldn't notice.

176
00:08:30,460 --> 00:08:32,460
And you didn't, did you?

177
00:08:33,460 --> 00:08:34,460
Well?

178
00:08:34,460 --> 00:08:36,460
Did it taste good?

179
00:08:36,460 --> 00:08:37,460
Huh?

180
00:08:37,460 --> 00:08:38,960
You're kidding me.

181
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:39,960
An eyeball?

182
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,460
Save me, Mom.

183
00:08:41,460 --> 00:08:42,460
What a detail.

184
00:08:42,460 --> 00:08:46,760
That's sick!

185
00:08:50,760 --> 00:08:51,760
Freaky.

186
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:55,760
Now that's a tone shift.

187
00:08:56,760 --> 00:08:57,760
Super cute.

188
00:08:58,760 --> 00:09:00,760
Wait, you took a picture of me?

189
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:02,760
You look so nice, I had to!

190
00:09:03,760 --> 00:09:05,760
This is the scariest one.

191
00:09:05,760 --> 00:09:07,760
Never mind, this one's worse.

192
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:11,060
Yeah, it'll be less creepy once we edit her face out.

193
00:09:11,060 --> 00:09:13,060
I really love the title screen.

194
00:09:13,060 --> 00:09:15,060
I was just so happy.

195
00:09:15,060 --> 00:09:18,060
It's a little embarrassing to admit it to all of you out loud.

196
00:09:18,060 --> 00:09:22,060
But during the shoot, as I looked into your faces,

197
00:09:22,060 --> 00:09:25,060
I got to step inside this world that means so much to me.

198
00:09:25,060 --> 00:09:29,060
I still can't believe I got to live in Sister Mira's shoes for a while.

199
00:09:29,060 --> 00:09:31,060
It felt like I was dreaming.

200
00:09:31,060 --> 00:09:35,360
The nuns sitting around the table every day.

201
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:39,360
That special family gathered together must have made Sister Mira so happy.

202
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:42,360
I know my heart felt so full, it could burst.

203
00:09:44,360 --> 00:09:45,360
Sad, sad!

204
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:47,360
Sister Mira and I aren't the same person exactly because

205
00:09:47,360 --> 00:09:50,360
I would never chop you up and eat you for dinner!

206
00:09:52,360 --> 00:09:54,360
Aren't you glad you joined in instead of just watching this time?

207
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,360
Yes!

208
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,360
Hey, Xingjiu.

209
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:58,360
Now that we're done, let me help you loosen up your wrap.

210
00:09:58,360 --> 00:10:00,360
Thanks, that would be awesome.

211
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:04,660
I know it's still a bit early, but once Aki is done washing off the blood,

212
00:10:04,660 --> 00:10:05,660
let's start cleaning up.

213
00:10:05,660 --> 00:10:07,660
Yeah, clean up will take a while.

214
00:10:15,660 --> 00:10:16,660
There you are.

215
00:10:16,660 --> 00:10:18,660
I've been looking for you.

216
00:10:18,660 --> 00:10:21,660
Do you want to check out the photos with the others?

217
00:10:21,660 --> 00:10:23,660
No, not in the slightest.

218
00:10:23,660 --> 00:10:26,660
I was surprised when you agreed to be in the group.

219
00:10:26,660 --> 00:10:28,660
Since you don't like horror stuff,

220
00:10:28,660 --> 00:10:30,960
I just figured that you would set this one out.

221
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:31,960
I hate it.

222
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:32,960
Huh?

223
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:34,960
And this shoot has only reaffirmed that.

224
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:35,960
Huh?

225
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:37,960
Then why'd you agree to participate at all?

226
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:39,960
You didn't have to.

227
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:42,960
I knew that I could suffer through a few hours.

228
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:44,460
Wakana Gojo.

229
00:10:44,460 --> 00:10:46,460
Just who do you think I am?

230
00:10:47,460 --> 00:10:50,960
Well, you're a great cosplayer with a big following?

231
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:51,460
Wrong!

232
00:10:51,460 --> 00:10:52,760
I'm Shinju's big sister!

233
00:10:52,760 --> 00:10:53,760
Huh?

234
00:10:53,760 --> 00:10:55,760
Did you see her eyes?

235
00:10:55,760 --> 00:10:57,760
How could I refuse?

236
00:10:57,760 --> 00:11:00,260
I'm responsible for my own dreams,

237
00:11:00,260 --> 00:11:02,260
and I have you, and Miyako,

238
00:11:02,260 --> 00:11:04,760
and the rest of these new allies to help me out.

239
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:08,760
But I'm the only one who can see to it that Shinju's dreams come true.

240
00:11:08,760 --> 00:11:09,760
Hmm.

241
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:11,760
Such a big sister.

242
00:11:11,760 --> 00:11:13,260
Were you listening to me?

243
00:11:13,260 --> 00:11:14,760
That's what I just said!

244
00:11:14,760 --> 00:11:17,560
I'm not myself right now.

245
00:11:17,560 --> 00:11:20,760
And there's nothing I can do to calm down or change my surroundings.

246
00:11:20,760 --> 00:11:23,060
When my emotions are compromised like this,

247
00:11:23,060 --> 00:11:25,060
I don't want to be around people.

248
00:11:25,060 --> 00:11:27,060
I need to be by myself.

249
00:11:28,560 --> 00:11:30,060
And yet...

250
00:11:32,060 --> 00:11:35,060
I despise the fact I had fun today.

251
00:11:37,060 --> 00:11:39,060
I'm done with group cosplays.

252
00:11:39,060 --> 00:11:41,060
No, no more!

253
00:11:41,060 --> 00:11:44,060
I'm far better off when I'm dressed up as a cutesy magical girl

254
00:11:44,060 --> 00:11:45,860
I'll grow them completely.

255
00:11:48,860 --> 00:11:49,860
Are you okay?

256
00:11:49,860 --> 00:11:51,360
She's not okay!

257
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:52,860
Did you scare her to death?

258
00:11:52,860 --> 00:11:54,360
You should try drinking some water!

259
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:54,860
Air!

260
00:11:54,860 --> 00:11:56,360
She needs fresh air!

261
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:59,360
It feels much better, loosen like this.

262
00:11:59,360 --> 00:12:00,860
Breathing is key.

263
00:12:00,860 --> 00:12:02,860
I'mma use some eyedrops, then I'll join you.

264
00:12:02,860 --> 00:12:03,860
Okay.

265
00:12:07,860 --> 00:12:09,360
Sorry, excuse me.

266
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:11,360
You're fine, no worries.

267
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:13,360
Your collar's undone.

268
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:15,160
Just a sec.

269
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:17,160
Thank you, I didn't notice.

270
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:20,660
Come to think of it,

271
00:12:20,660 --> 00:12:23,660
we shot partner scenes of almost everyone

272
00:12:23,660 --> 00:12:25,660
except Akira and Maureen.

273
00:12:26,660 --> 00:12:28,660
Maybe Suzuka just forgot.

274
00:12:29,660 --> 00:12:30,660
Oh, hey!

